WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.336
This is a manul.

00:00:02.356 --> 00:00:04.980
The grumpiest cat on Earth.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.264
It doesn't rush.

00:00:07.284 --> 00:00:08.787
It waits.

00:00:08.807 --> 00:00:10.310
It watches.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.433
And when it finally moves,

00:00:12.453 --> 00:00:14.980
it gets exactly what it wants.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.480
We built a video editor

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.980
that works the same way.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
Most editors make you operate them.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.980
Tracks, keyframes, a hundred tiny panels.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.715
Manul flips that around.

00:00:27.735 --> 00:00:28.848
You direct.

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:29.980
It edits.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.980
Drop in your footage, and say what you want,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.980
in plain words.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.380
When something's off, point at it.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.780
Draw a box on the frame,

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.980
and leave a note on that exact moment.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.605
Manul does the work on your own computer,

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:46.980
and you watch every step as it happens.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.154
Nothing gets overwritten.

00:00:48.174 --> 00:00:51.284
Each edit comes back as a new version.

00:00:51.304 --> 00:00:53.241
Scrub the before and after,

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:55.980
then keep it, or send it back.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.730
Titles, captions and music stay editable.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:04.105
And one film becomes every shape: wide,

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:05.980
vertical, and square.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.180
It even has a browser of its own,

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.780
for references and footage.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.980
Your Chrome stays yours, unless you say otherwise.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.288
Your footage never leaves home.

00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:19.980
Bring your own Claude, Gemini or GPT key.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:21.509
Manul.

00:01:21.529 --> 00:01:23.744
Free, and open source.

00:01:23.764 --> 00:01:24.862
You direct.

00:01:24.882 --> 00:01:25.980
It edits.
